iel Pestano"] ", a catcher who batted .442 at the 2000-2004 Olympics, and drove in 14 runs in Athens.  The Greeks played in the Olympic tournament as the host nation, although the game is almost unknown in Greece.  They recruited a number of Greek-Americans to play for them, and to their credit, did not finish last, defeating Italy 12-7, to match them with 1-6 records, and placing 7th on run differential."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button174607", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button174607').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins/At Bats"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses/Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points/Hits"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs For/Doubles"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Against/Triples"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Home Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "RBIs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Walks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Strikeouts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Stolen Bases/Caught Stealing"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sacrifice Hits/Sacrifice Flies"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Batting Average"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Won/Lost/Saves"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Innings Pitched"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Hits Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Earned Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Home Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Strikeouts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Bases-on-Balls"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Earned